From: LixNix <105106115+LixNix@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: print_task_config: validate nozzle diameter per mapped filament

Check each used logical filament's nozzle diameter against the physical
extruder it is mapped to through extruder_map_table, instead of comparing
nozzle_diameter[0] against every used extruder. Also reject negative
MAP_TABLE and SET_PRINT_USED_EXTRUDERS indices, refuse to start when
NOZZLE_DIAMETER_LIST cannot be parsed, and accept LINE_WIDTH_PERCENT.

Original work by @LixNix (patches 01 and 02 of the U1 2.0.0.205
nozzle-map fix), rebased onto firmware-extended without changes.

